  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4421050,
    "UIName": "Mingan",
    "Id": "chassisdef_mingan_MNG-C",
    "Name": "Mingan",
    "Details": "The Mingan C configuration is optimized for close combat in urban environments. It employs four Improved Heavy Medium Lasers and a Targeting Computer to devastating effect, aided by a jump capacity of 180 meters and surplus heat dissipation, making it deadly at close range.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Cowl</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
