  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Mingan, named for the Gray Wolf, is a heavy-hitting light OmniMech replacing the aging Adder. Built alongside the Wulfen and Warwolf, it shares a similar wolf-like design and components, simplifying repairs and logistics. Deployed heavily by the Wolf Empire, the Mingan excels in versatility—switching between close combat and long-range fire support. Its Laser-Reflective armor offers strong defense against energy weapons, making it a prized and adaptive unit in the Republic of the Sphere assault.",
